ructural integrity and compatibility, flight loads, stage separation, and subsystems operation including testing of restart of the S-IVB stage, and to evaluate the Apollo command module heat shield. The Apollo 4 was launched on November 9, 1967 from KSC.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"Taken on\u00a01 August 1967","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://images.nasa.gov/details/6757953\">https://images.nasa.gov/details/6757953</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"NASA","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"<table class=\"licensetpl\" style=\"display:none\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"licensetpl_short\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl_long\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl_link_req\">false</span><span class=\"licensetpl_attr_req\">false</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; clear: both; margin: 0.5em auto; background-color: var(--background-color-progressive-subtle, #f7f8ff); color: var(--color-base, #202122); border: var(--border-subtle, 2px solid #8888aa); border-spacing: 8px; padding: 0px;\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"layouttemplate\" lang=\"en\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Public domain\"><img alt=\"Public domain\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/PD-icon.svg/120px-PD-icon.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/PD-icon.svg/250px-PD-icon.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"196\" data-file-height=\"196\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td><i>This file is in the <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/public_domain\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:public domain\